{
  "_readme": [
    "Centres (izikhungo) for the TSHK Compass Centres tab.",
    "Edit this file to add, rename or move a centre - no code change is needed.",
    "Fields per centre:",
    "  id       : unique string, used as a stable key (required)",
    "  name     : display name (required)",
    "  region   : group heading, e.g. \"Gauteng\" (required; defaults to \"Other\")",
    "  address  : street address, shown on the card and sent to the maps app",
    "  town     : optional suburb/town, improves the search when present",
    "  phone    : international format, e.g. \"+27 67 300 3886\" (enables Call)",
    "  lat, lng : decimal degrees (enables Map / Directions / the pin on the map)",
    "  verified : false while the coordinates still need checking on the ground",
    "Ordering is automatic: regions alphabetically, centres alphabetically inside",
    "each region. Centres without coordinates are listed last and show no pin."
  ],
